SOURCE ATTRIBUTION
------------------
The knowledge content is a derivative summary of legislative-drafting standards
published by the Ministry of Government Legislation (법제처), Republic of Korea
(public government works). Copyright in the original standards belongs to 법제처.
This repository is an unofficial, derivative study aid and is not an official
publication of 법제처. Always verify against the original before citing.


